Scenario Practice

How do you handle a sudden 20% spike in call volume during an intraday shift?

Prepare a structured response covering:

Identify the volume spike.

Compare actual volume against forecast.

Check staffing and availability.

Review real-time adherence.

Identify available / offline agents.

Coordinate with Operations / WFM.

Consider overtime, breaks, or shift adjustments where appropriate.

Monitor SLA and queue performance.

Document the variance and update the forecast if required.

