Final Preparation Strategy

The goal is not just to watch the videos.

Spend the majority of your available preparation time on:

Building MIS reports

Solving Excel problems

Creating Pivot Tables

Cleaning datasets

Calculating WFM metrics

Building a simple dashboard

Practicing scenario-based interview questions

Answering technical questions aloud

Explaining your approach step-by-step

Rule of thumb: Practice > Watching.

The interviewer is more likely to evaluate whether you can apply Excel, interpret data, explain WFM metrics, identify operational issues, and communicate your reasoning than whether you have simply watched training videos.

